Z||000004||Tigger||12-18-2001||09:50 AM||||Fuzzy Dice, that's custom.<P>Forget the fog lamps and clear tails and get yourself a Grant wheel and shift knob.<P>Remember you're on a $3000 budget.<P>I would stress on the things that will make the outside of the car custom.  Paint, scoops, etc.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 12-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Oreif||12-18-2001||09:53 AM||||4.9L $1000<BR>acrylic enamel paint with 1 clear coat $200<BR>side scoops $200<BR>lowering springs $200<BR>wheels and tires $800<BR>Mr. Mikes seats $400<BR>Misc. $200 (Those small little things you always need like body panel rivets, clips, sandpaper, parts for the engine swap, etc.)<P>||||reg||1
